  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "We interchange the signs in the given equations & solve them using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4f79570d5e475f4f083df8b206941fff904dea5e5344d0a6aa320711ad67144f.png] \n\nAfter interchanging '+ and ×':\n\nOption 1) 7 + 5 × 2 – 8 ÷ 4 = 36\n\n7 × 5 + 2 - __**8 ÷ 4**__ = 36\n\n__**7 **____**× 5**__ + 2 - 2 = 36\n\n__**35 + 2**__ - 2 = 36\n\n__**37 - 2**__ = 36\n\n35 ≠ 36\n\n**Option 2) 95 ÷ 19 + 5 × 3 – 6 = 22**\n\n__**95 ÷ 19**__ × 5 + 3 - 6 = 22\n\n__**5 × 5**__ + 3 - 6 = 22\n\n__**25 + 3**__ - 6 = 22\n\n__**28 - 6**__ = 22\n\n**22 = 22**\n\nOption 3) 13 + 4 × 5 – 6 ÷ 2 = 51\n\n13 × 4 + 5 - __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 51 \n\n__**13 × 4**__ + 5 - 3 = 51 \n\n__**52 + 5**__ - 3 = 51 \n\n__**57 - 3**__ = 51 \n\n54 ≠ 51\n\nOption 4) 4 × 3 + 6 – 7 ÷ 1 = 18 \n\n4 + 3 × 6 - __**7 ÷ 1**__ = 18\n\n4 + __**3 × 6**__ - 7 = 18\n\n__**4 + **__**__18__** - 7 = 18\n\n__**22 - 7**__ = 18\n\n15 ≠ 18\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
